  "summary": "To measure the stiffness of your denture base resins when bent, you will need to perform a flexural test, typically a 3-point bending test. The Instron 5967 universal mechanical testing system is well-suited for this measurement. You will need to confirm that the lab has the appropriate bending fixture and load cell for your specific sample dimensions."
}

